If AMI is suspected, CT should be performed with contrast enhancement in the arterial and venous phases. The arterial phase allows for accurate detection of vascular pathology with detailed vascular reconstruction, while the venous phase provides assessment of intestinal perfusion (
Fig. 1
). Multi-

